<overview>
<p>Every Concordat world maintains infantry formations as the first line of planetary defense, drawn from a population whose fierce independence and hatred of foreign aggression run deep. Mechanized wheeled platoons offer a balance of speed and economy, their wheeled transports being cheaper to maintain than hover or tracked alternatives. For a military that must stretch limited resources across a significant number of garrison worlds, this cost efficiency matters as much as tactical performance.</p><p>Support troops operate man-portable long-range missile launchers capable of engaging targets at distances well beyond personal weapon range, providing the platoon with indirect fire capability against vehicles and fortified positions.</p>
</overview>

